{{ define "terms" }}
  {{ template "layout_header" . }}

  <div class="mt-static-page mt-static-page--document">
    <header class="mt-static-header">
      <h1 class="mt-static-title">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="mt-static-lede">These terms are intentionally short and limited to the project as it exists today.</p>
    </header>

    <article class="mt-static-document">
      <section class="mt-static-section">
        <h2>Project status</h2>
        <div class="mt-static-section__body">
          <p>ManaTomb is a free, non-commercial hobby project for Magic: The Gathering players.</p>
          <p>The app may change, break, or go offline without notice while development continues.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-static-section">
        <h2>Accounts and public decks</h2>
        <div class="mt-static-section__body">
          <p>You are responsible for the deck names, descriptions, and other content you choose to save or publish.</p>
          <p>If you publish a deck, treat it as public information until you make it private again or remove it.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-static-section">
        <h2>Card data and intellectual property</h2>
        <div class="mt-static-section__body">
          <p>ManaTomb uses card data and images provided through Scryfall.</p>
          <p>Card data is credited to Scryfall, and card images remain the property of Wizards of the Coast. The project should remain free and non-commercial.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-static-section">
        <h2>No warranty</h2>
        <div class="mt-static-section__body">
          <p>ManaTomb is provided as-is. Deck suggestions, card information, search results, and gameplay tools may be incomplete or inaccurate.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-static-section">
        <h2>Support</h2>
        <div class="mt-static-section__body">
          <p>Feedback and bug reports currently go through the project&apos;s <a href="{{ projectIssuesURL }}" class="mt-static-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub issue tracker<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>

  {{ template "layout_footer" . }}
{{ end }}
